{
  "version": 1,
  "id": "godot",
  "description": "Godot 4 游戏开发项目：工程骨架（project.godot）+ 约定文件 + Godot AI 插件（MCP 把 AI 接进编辑器，随项目入库）。进度用 forge plan 记账。",
  "items": [
    { "from": "payload:AGENTS.md", "to": "AGENTS.md" },
